# Authoritative Loops operating command

Normal production scheduling uses one sequential overnight owner, not the
former eight continuously recurring processes.

The six-symbol production scope is:

`AAPL AMZN GOOG MU NVDA SNDK`

## Nightly owner

Run once after the 17:00 America/Los_Angeles stock close:

```powershell
cd C:\dev\ducketz
Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope Process -ExecutionPolicy Bypass
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
python -u -m ml.overnight_runtime --datastore-target pc --once --scheduled
```

The checked-in Scheduled task wakes at 17:05 PT on weekdays and runs this exact
command and actively supervises it until completion. It reads progress/errors
at least once a minute, makes verified non-trading repairs, and resumes failed
stages. A health watch checks every ten minutes for abandoned work.
The `--scheduled` guard requires the local date to be an XNYS
session whose 17:00 PT action window has finished. A weekday exchange holiday
writes an audited no-op receipt and preserves the existing gameplan pointer. On
an eligible session it performs, sequentially:

1. Loop A close fetch and production OPRA history append.
2. Directional Loop B materialization/training/prediction.
3. Evaluate all saved Gameplans from September 4, retaining pending forecasts.
4. `1h`/`4h`/`1d`/`1w` Options Strategy profit-model training.
5. Options Strategy candidate generation.
6. Immutable next-session Gameplan generation.

The command fails closed at the first invalid cursor, provider response,
receipt, model, or publication. It has no broker/order authority.

The complete contract is
`docs/loops-system-analysis/NIGHTLY_GAMEPLAN.md`.

## Output authority

The final atomic pointer is:

`C:\DATASTORE\ml\nightly-gameplan-latest\run.json`

It selects one checksum-verified generation containing 144 forecasts: 24 per
symbol (14 hourly, four 4-hour, five daily, one direct weekly) plus 144 frozen
options-strategy intents.

## Optional paper/advisory read

During 04:00–17:00 PT, the bounded consumer is:

```powershell
python -m ml.gameplan_executor --datastore-target pc --once
```

It can only read the immutable gameplan and write a paper decision receipt.
It cannot fetch, train, replan, import a broker client, or place an order.

## OPRA maintenance

Loop A's nightly stage owns incremental maintenance of `definition`, `cbbo-1m`,
and `ohlcv-1h` for all six symbols. Overnight currentness means complete coverage
of the most recently finished session. A final quote can be hours old after the
market closes and still be the newest valid planning observation. A future live
order would require a separate same-leg execution-time quote check.

Manual repair/bootstrap details remain in `options-opra-history.md`. Do not run
the standalone OPRA Scheduled task alongside the nightly owner.

## Progress and recovery

```powershell
python -m ml.overnight_runtime --datastore-target pc --status
```

Use the supervised repair and `--resume-run` procedure in `NIGHTLY_GAMEPLAN.md`.
The deadline is 04:00 Pacific on the next exchange session, including weekends
and holidays. Quiet but healthy fits can keep running for hours. The daytime
stock trader is a separate active consumer of the saved Gameplan.
